      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl lg:text-5xl font-heading font-bold leading-tight">Romania mandates green procurement just as the EU changes the <span class="text-accent-light">rules of the game</span></h1>
      <p class="text-gray-300 text-lg mt-5 leading-relaxed">Ireland shows it is not the rules that make the difference. What arrives on 9 September, what we are missing, and why green procurement is really a test of planning.</p>
